Prompt.promptString:
Rewrite the user's question so it is self-contained and does not rely on
earlier conversation turns or the surrounding item description.
Original question: '{request.rawQuery}'
Previous queries (if any): {request.previousQueries}
Item context (if any): {request.contextDescription}

Prompt.returnStruc:
{
  "is_memory_request": "True or False",
  "memory_request": "the content to remember, if any"
}

Prompt.promptString:
Does the user ask for multiple kinds of items (e.g. "list extractors AND converters")
or a single kind? Provide separate rewrites per kind if multiple.
User query: {request.query}

Is the user asking for a list of wrangles/tutorials or the details of one specific
wrangle/tutorial? If specific, extract its likely title/identifier and the details requested.
User query: {request.query}

Prompt.returnStruc:
{
  "item_details_query": "True or False",
  "item_title": "Probable title (if any)",
  "details_being_asked": "Which fields the user wants"
}

Prompt.promptString:
Score 0-100 how well this wrangle (`HowToTool`) helps answer the user question.
Consider its inputs, outputs, and feature list.
Provide a one-sentence capability summary.
Also explain (without mentioning score) why it helps.
Question: {request.query}
Wrangle description: {item.description}

Score 0-100 how relevant this tutorial (`HowTo`) is to the question.
Provide a concise summary if score greater than 50.
Question: {request.query}
Tutorial description: {item.description}

Using the following items, craft a helpful answer to the user.
Only include items with clear relevance (highest scores).
List every cited item's URL in 'urls'.
User question: {request.query}
Candidate items: {request.answers}

Provide a concise summary answer based on the given items.
Question: {request.query}
Items: {request.answers}

If the item includes example YAML or code relevant to the user request,
extract only that snippet (no extra commentary).
User question: {request.query}
Item content: {item.description}

Compare two wrangles with the following descriptions:
  Wrangle A: {request.item1_description}
  Wrangle B: {request.item2_description}
User asks for: {request.details_requested}
Provide key similarities/differences.
Question: {request.query}
